🎬 AI Learning Series (From Zero → AI Platform Engineer)
Imagine the whole AI system is a smart company.Each AWS service is an employee.
By the end, you'll know what every employee does.

Instead of reading long notes, we'll learn as a 15-episode animated story:

🎬 Episode 1: What is AI? (Robot story)
This is AI. AI always does only three things:
  Takes Input
  Thinks
  Gives Output
🎬 Episode 2: How ChatGPT thinks
  Reads your sentence
  Understands your intent
  Predicts the best next words
  Sends the answer
  It does not search Google every time.It predicts the next words based on what it has learned.
🎬 Episode 3: What is an LLM?
LLM = Large Language Model
  The LLM is the robot's brain.    
Examples:  Claude
            GPT
            Llama
          Amazon Nova
  All are different brains.
🎬 Episode 4: What is Bedrock?
Bedrock says - "Which brain do you want?"
Bedrock doesn't answer questions itself. It connects you to a brain.
🎬 Episode 5: What is RAG?
That library trip is RAG. 
Robot says
"I forgot."
You say
"Go to the library."
